nimiento de carreteras y vías urbanas para sostener la movilidad y la conexión entre comunidades.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"service-details\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-1\">\n                                <span class=\"service-detail-label\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-1-1\">\n                                    Qué hacemos\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-detail-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"service action value text\" data-reason=\"text content replaced by script on tab selection\" id=\"serviceAction\">\n                                    Coordinamos intervenciones y seguimiento de obra.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-2\">\n                                <span class=\"service-detail-label\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-2-1\">\n                                    Para quién\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-detail-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"service audience value text\" data-reason=\"text content replaced by script on tab selection\" id=\"serviceAudience\">\n                                    Municipios, parroquias y comunidades.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <a class=\"service-link\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-5\" href=\"#acceso\" id=\"serviceLink\">\n                            Consultar en el sistema\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-2-2-5-1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n     