 </i>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        <nav aria-label=\"Navegación móvil\" class=\"drawer-nav\" data-kid=\"1-5-2\">\n            <a class=\"drawer-link\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-1\" href=\"#inicio\">\n                Inicio\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"drawer-link\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-2\" href=\"#acerca\">\n                Cómo trabajamos\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"drawer-link\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-3\" href=\"#servicios\">\n                Capacidades\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"drawer-link\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-4\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                Contacto\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"drawer-actions\" data-kid=\"1-5-3\">\n            <button aria-label=\"Activar modo oscuro\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"theme-toggle\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile theme toggle button\" data-reason=\"aria-pressed and aria-label toggled by script\" data-theme-toggle=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-moon icon\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile theme toggle icon\" data-reason=\"icon class dynamically switched between sun and moon by script\" data-theme-icon=\"\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile theme toggle accessible label\" data-reason=\"text content updated to reflect current theme by script\" data-theme-label=\"\">\n                    Activar modo oscuro\n                </span>\n            </button>\n            <a class=\"button button-primary\" data-kid=\"1-5-3-2\" href=\"#acceso\">\n                Entrar al sistema\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-log-in icon\" data-kid=\"1-5-3-2-1\">\n                </i>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n    <main data-kid=\"1-6\" id=\"contenido-principal\">\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" class=\"hero-section\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" id=\"inicio\">\n            <div class=\"section-frame\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"hero-topline\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1\">\n                    <span class=\"line-label\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1-1\">\n                        Instituto de Vialidad del Estado Lara\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1-2\">\n                        Gestión pública · Infraestructura · Territorio\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-grid\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2\">\n                    <article class=\"hero-lead-cell js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero lead content container\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                Una gestión que se mueve\n                            </span>\n                            <h1 data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-2\" id=\"hero-title\">\n                                Conectamos Lara, municipio a municipio.\n                            </h1>\n                            <p data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                                Planificamos, construimos y conservamos la red vial que une municipios, parroquias y comunidades del estado. Cada intervención empieza con una lectura cercana del territorio.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"hero-actions\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-4\">\n                                <a class=\"button button-primary\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-4-1\" href=\"#acceso\">\n                                    Acceder al sistema\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-log-in icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </a>\n                                <a class=\"button button-ghost\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-4-2\" href=\"#acerca\">\n                                    Conocer nuestra gestión\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-down-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"hero-signature\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            Excelencia, transparencia y compromiso institucional\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <figure class=\"hero-image-cell js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero image container\">\n                        <img alt=\"Entrada de la sede de Invilara en Lara\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/img/invilara_entrada.jpeg\"/>\n                        <figcaption class=\"image-caption\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                Sede Invilara\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                Barquisimeto · Lara\n                            </span>\n                        </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n                    <div class=\"hero-info-cell js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero info cell 1\">\n                        <span class=\"cell-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-3-1\">\n                            01 / 04\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Obras viales\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-3-3\">\n                            Construcción, rehabilitación y mantenimiento con presencia en el territorio.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-info-cell accent js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"hero info cell 2\">\n                        <span class=\"cell-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-4-1\">\n                            02 / 04\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-4-2\">\n                            Inspecciones técnicas\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-4-3\">\n                            Observamos la vía para decidir con responsabilidad.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-info-cell dark js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"hero info cell 3\">\n                        <span class=\"cell-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-5-1\">\n                            03 / 04\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-5-2\">\n                            Solicitudes ciudadanas\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-5-3\">\n                            La comunidad ayuda a orientar las prioridades de atención.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-info-cell js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-6\" data-name=\"hero info cell 4\">\n                        <span class=\"cell-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-6-1\">\n                            04 / 04\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-6-2\">\n                            Municipios y parroquias\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-6-3\">\n                            Una gestión regional que entiende los recorridos cotidianos.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-scroll-note\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-3\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"scroll-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-3-1\">\n                        ↓\n                    </span>\n                    Explora la gestión vial\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"about-title\" class=\"section about-section\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" id=\"acerca\">\n            <div class=\"section-frame\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1\">\n                <div class=\"section-heading js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1\">\n                    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1-1\">\n                        01 / Presencia territorial\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1-2\" id=\"about-title\">\n                        La gestión vial se entiende mejor desde el territorio.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1-3\">\n                        Invilara articula equipos, proyectos y decisiones para responder a las condiciones reales de Lara: sus rutas, sus comunidades y las personas que las recorren cada día.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"impact-layout\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2\">\n                    <div aria-label=\"Pilares de la gestión de Invilara\" class=\"ladder\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1\">\n                        <article class=\"ladder-item js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"ladder item 1\">\n                            <div class=\"ladder-copy\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"mini-label\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-1-1\">\n                                    Construcción / Rehabilitación\n                                </span>\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-1-2\">\n                                    Obras que devuelven continuidad.\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-1-3\">\n                                    Intervenimos carreteras y autopistas para recuperar trayectos, conectar servicios y acompañar el desarrollo regional.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <figure class=\"ladder-media\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <img alt=\"Equipo trabajando en una obra vial\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-1-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/img/1.jpeg\"/>\n                            </figure>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"ladder-item js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"ladder item 2\">\n                            <div class=\"ladder-copy\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"mini-label\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    Supervisión / Seguridad\n                                </span>\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                    Inspeccionar antes de decidir.\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                                    La observación técnica permite priorizar mantenimiento y actuar con criterios de seguridad, cumplimiento y durabilidad.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <figure class=\"ladder-media\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <img alt=\"Personal realizando una inspección en carretera\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-2-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/img/2.jpeg\"/>\n                            </figure>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"ladder-item js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"ladder item 3\">\n                            <div class=\"ladder-copy\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                <span class=\"mini-label\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                    Comunidad / Atención\n                                </span>\n                                <h3 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                                    Escuchar también es construir.\n                                </h3>\n                                <p data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-1-3\">\n                                    Las solicitudes ciudadanas acercan las necesidades de municipios y parroquias a la planificación de la gestión vial.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <figure class=\"ladder-media\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                <img alt=\"Trabajadores atendiendo una afectación en la vía\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1-3-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/img/6.jpeg\"/>\n                            </figure>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                    <aside class=\"impact-aside js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aside-mark\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                            L\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                            Del territorio a la decisión.\n                        </h3>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-3\">\n                            Una institución vial se reconoce en la forma en que convierte una necesidad concreta en una respuesta organizada.\n                        </p>\n                        <ul class=\"territory-list\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-4\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-4-1\">\n                                Planificación con lectura de las rutas.\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-4-2\">\n                                Proyectos con seguimiento técnico.\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-4-3\">\n                                Contrataciones con responsabilidad pública.\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-4-4\">\n                                Equipos comprometidos con Lara.\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                        <a class=\"inline-link\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-5\" href=\"#servicios\">\n                            Ver nuestras capacidades\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2-5-1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"video-title\" class=\"video-section\" data-kid=\"1-6-3\" id=\"video\">\n            <div class=\"video-inner\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1\">\n                <div class=\"video-heading js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1-1\">\n                        <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1-1-1\">\n                            02 / Invilara en movimiento\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1-1-2\" id=\"video-title\">\n                            El trabajo se ve en la vía.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-1-2\">\n                        Una mirada institucional al equipo, la infraestructura y el compromiso que sostienen cada jornada de gestión.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"video-cutout js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"video cutout container\">\n                    <div class=\"video-frame\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1\">\n                        <video aria-label=\"Video institucional de Invilara\" autoplay=\"\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"institutional video element\" data-reason=\"playback state (play/pause) toggled by script\" id=\"institutionalVideo\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\">\n                            <source data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-1-1\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/video/invilara.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/>\n                        </video>\n                        <div class=\"video-bar\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                Registro institucional · Lara\n                            </span>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Pausar video\" class=\"video-toggle\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"video playback toggle button\" data-reason=\"aria-label and icon content updated on play/pause by script\" id=\"videoToggle\" type=\"button\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-pause icon\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"video playback toggle icon\" data-reason=\"class switched between pause and play icon by script\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"services-title\" class=\"section services-section\" data-kid=\"1-6-4\" id=\"servicios\">\n            <div class=\"section-frame\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"section-heading js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-1\">\n                    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-1-1\">\n                        03 / Capacidades\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-1-2\" id=\"services-title\">\n                        Una gestión completa para cada etapa de la vía.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-1-3\">\n                        Conoce cómo se organiza el trabajo de Invilara y encuentra el punto de contacto que corresponde a tu necesidad.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-layout\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"service-list\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1\">\n                        <p class=\"service-list-intro\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-1\">\n                            Selecciona una capacidad para ver su enfoque operativo y la forma en que acompaña al territorio.\n                        </p>\n                        <button aria-controls=\"servicePreview\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"service-row is-active\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection button (obras)\" data-service=\"obras\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"service-row-top\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"service-row-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"service-row-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        01\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        Obras viales\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-row-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-summary\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                Construcción, rehabilitación y conservación de carreteras y autopistas.\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-mobile-detail\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"mobile detail text (obras)\" data-reason=\"hidden attribute toggled by script\" hidden=\"\">\n                                Convertimos la planificación en intervenciones concretas que recuperan la continuidad y la seguridad de la red vial.\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-controls=\"servicePreview\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"service-row\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"service selection button (inspecciones)\" data-service=\"inspecciones\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"service-row-top\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                <span class=\"service-row-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"service-row-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                                        02\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1-1-2\">\n                                        Inspecciones técnicas\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-row-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-1-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-summary\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                Supervisión del estado de la vialidad para orientar decisiones responsables.\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-mobile-detail\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"mobile detail text (inspecciones)\" data-reason=\"hidden attribute toggled by script\" hidden=\"\">\n                                Observamos, registramos y acompañamos el cumplimiento técnico y administrativo de los proyectos viales.\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-controls=\"servicePreview\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"service-row\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"service selection button (proyectos)\" data-service=\"proyectos\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"service-row-top\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1\">\n                                <span class=\"service-row-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"service-row-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1-1-1\">\n                                        03\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1-1-2\">\n                                        Proyectos y contratos\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-row-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1-2\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-1-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-summary\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-2\">\n                                Planificación estratégica y alianzas calificadas para ampliar el alcance regional.\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-mobile-detail\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"mobile detail text (proyectos)\" data-reason=\"hidden attribute toggled by script\" hidden=\"\">\n                                Gestionamos proyectos y contrataciones con criterios de transparencia, seguimiento y responsabilidad institucional.\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-controls=\"servicePreview\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"service-row\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"service selection button (solicitudes)\" data-service=\"solicitudes\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"service-row-top\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1\">\n                                <span class=\"service-row-title\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"service-row-index\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1-1-1\">\n                                        04\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1-1-2\">\n                                        Solicitudes ciudadanas\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"service-row-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1-2\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-1-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-summary\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-2\">\n                                Un canal para acercar requerimientos del territorio a la gestión vial.\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"service-row-mobile-detail\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-1-5-3\" data-name=\"mobile detail text (solicitudes)\" data-reason=\"hidden attribute toggled by script\" hidden=\"\">\n                                La información de la comunidad ayuda a comprender dónde la vialidad necesita atención y seguimiento.\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"service-preview js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"service preview container\" id=\"servicePreview\">\n                        <div class=\"service-preview-image-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <img alt=\"Obra vial en ejecución\" class=\"service-preview-image\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"service preview image\" decoding=\"async\" id=\"servicePreviewImage\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/img/3.jpeg\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"service-preview-copy\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <p class=\"preview-tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"service preview category tag\" id=\"servicePreviewTag\">\n                                Construcción / Mantenimiento\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"service preview title\" id=\"servicePreviewTitle\">\n                                Obras viales\n                            </h3>\n                            <p data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"service preview description\" id=\"servicePreviewDescription\">\n                                Diseñamos y ejecutamos intervenciones que ayudan a mantener conectadas a las comunidades de Lara.\n                            </p>\n                            <a class=\"inline-link\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2-4\" href=\"#acceso\" id=\"servicePreviewLink\">\n                                Solicitar orientación\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-right-arrow-alt icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1-2-2-2-4-1\">\n                                </i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" class=\"contact-section\" data-kid=\"1-6-5\" id=\"contacto\">\n            <div class=\"section-frame\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"contact-layout\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"contact-panel js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1\">\n                        <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                            04 / Atención institucional\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-2\" id=\"contact-title\">\n                            Hablemos del territorio.\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-3\">\n                            Estamos disponibles para orientar a funcionarios, contratistas y comunidades sobre la gestión vial del Estado Lara.\n                        </p>\n                        <ul class=\"contact-list\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4\">\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-1\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-map icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-1-2\">\n                                    Avenida Fuerzas Armadas, esquina con Calle 57, Barquisimeto, Estado Lara.\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-2\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-phone icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-2-2\">\n                                    +58 251-4424548\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-3\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-envelope icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-3-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-3-2\">\n                                    info@invilara.gob.ve\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                            <li data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-4\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-time icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-4-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-1-4-4-2\">\n                                    Lunes a viernes · 8:00 AM a 4:00 PM\n                                </span>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"official-panel js-reveal\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2\" id=\"acceso\">\n                        <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-1\">\n                            Acceso para funcionarios\n                        </span>\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-2\">\n                            La gestión también continúa en línea.\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-3\">\n                            Ingresa al sistema para administrar solicitudes, proyectos, inspecciones y procesos de Invilara desde un solo lugar.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"access-points\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4\">\n                            <div class=\"access-point\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-1\">\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-1-1\">\n                                    Solicitudes\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                    Registra y consulta requerimientos del territorio.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"access-point\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-2\">\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-2-1\">\n                                    Proyectos\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                    Da seguimiento a la planificación y ejecución.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <a class=\"button button-primary\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-5\" href=\"#inicio\">\n                            Iniciar sesión\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-log-in icon\" data-kid=\"1-6-5-1-1-2-5-1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"utility-footer\" data-kid=\"1-7\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n        <div class=\"section-frame\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\">\n            <div class=\"footer-grid\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"footer-brand\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\">\n                    <img alt=\"Invilara\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/static/assets/img/INVILARA%20LOGO%20OFICIAL%20HORIZONTAL.png\"/>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-2\">\n                        Instituto de Vialidad del Estado Lara. Gestionando el desarrollo vial con excelencia, transparencia y compromiso institucional.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"footer-heading\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-1\">\n                        Navegación\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#inicio\">\n                                Inicio\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#acerca\">\n                                Cómo trabajamos\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-3\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#servicios\">\n                                Capacidades\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-4\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                                Contacto\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3\">\n                    <h3 class=\"footer-heading\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-1\">\n                        Atención\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-1\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-1-1\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                                Información de contacto\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-2\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-2-1\" href=\"#acceso\">\n                                Acceso institucional\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-3\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-3-2-3-1\" href=\"#video\">\n                                Video institucional\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4\">\n                    <h3 class=\"footer-heading\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-1\">\n                        Redes sociales\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                            <a data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2-1-1\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/invilaraoficial\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bxl-instagram icon\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2-1-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                @invilaraoficial\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2-2\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-4-2-2-1\">\n                                Estado Lara · Venezuela\n                            </span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-bottom\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\">\n                    © Instituto de Vialidad del Estado Lara (Invilara).\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\">\n                    Transparencia · Compromiso · Territorio\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <div aria-label=\"Accesos rápidos\" class=\"access-dock\" data-kid=\"1-8\">\n        <a aria-label=\"Ir al acceso institucional\" class=\"dock-button primary\" data-kid=\"1-8-1\" href=\"#acceso\" title=\"Acceso institucional\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-log-in icon\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-1\">\n            </i>\n        </a>\n        <a aria-label=\"Ir a contacto\" class=\"dock-button\" data-kid=\"1-8-2\" href=\"#contacto\" title=\"Contacto\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"bx bx-phone icon\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1\">\n            </i>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    (function () {\n  const page = document.getElementById('invilara-page');\n  if (!page) return;\n  const drawer = document.getElementById('mobileDrawer');\n  const backdrop = document.getElementById('drawerBackdrop');\n  const drawerOpen = document.getElementById('drawerOpen');\n  const drawerClose = document.getElementById('drawerClose');\n  let lastFocus = drawerOpen;\n\n  function setTheme(theme) {\n    const dark = theme === 'dark';\n    page.dataset.theme = dark ? 'dark' : 'light';\n    try { localStorage.setItem('invilara-theme', dark ? 'dark' : 'light'); } catch (e) {}\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-theme-toggle]').forEach(function (button) {\n      button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(dark));\n      button.setAttribute('aria-label', dark ? 'Activar modo claro' : 'Activar modo oscuro');\n      const label = button.querySelector('[data-theme-label]');\n      if (label) label.textContent = dark ? 'Activar modo claro' : 'Activar modo oscuro';\n      const icon = button.querySelector('[data-theme-icon]');\n      if (icon) icon.className = 'bx ' + (dark ? 'bx-sun' : 'bx-moon') + ' icon';\n    });\n  }\n  let savedTheme = 'light';\n  try { savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('invilara-theme') || 'light'; } catch (e) {}\n  setTheme(savedTheme);\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-theme-toggle]').forEach(function (button) { button.addEventListener('click', function () { setTheme(page.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'); }); });\n\n  function openDrawer() {\n    lastFocus = document.activeElement || drawerOpen;\n    drawer.classList.add('is-open');\n    backdrop.classList.add('is-open');\n    drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');\n    backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');\n    drawerOpen.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    drawerClose.focus();\n  }\n  function closeDrawer(restore) {\n    drawer.classList.remove('is-open');\n    backdrop.classList.remove('is-open');\n    drawer.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n    backdrop.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n    drawerOpen.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    document.body.style.overflow = '';\n    if (restore !== false && lastFocus) lastFocus.focus();\n  }\n  drawerOpen.addEventListener('click', openDrawer);\n  drawerClose.addEventListener('click', function () { closeDrawer(true); });\n  backdrop.addEventListener('click', function () { closeDrawer(true); });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.drawer-link, .drawer-actions .button').forEach(function (link) { link.addEventListener('click', function () { closeDrawer(false); }); });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (event) {\n    if (event.key === 'Escape' && drawer.classList.contains('is-open')) { closeDrawer(true); return; }\n    if (event.key === 'Tab' && drawer.classList.contains('is-open')) {\n      const focusable = drawer.querySelectorAll('button, a[href]');\n      const first = focusable[0];\n      const last = focusable[focusable.length - 1];\n      if (event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === first) { event.preventDefault(); last.focus(); }\n      else if (!event.shiftKey && document.activeElement === last) { event.preventDefault(); first.focus(); }\n    }\n  });\n\n  const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link[data-section]'));\n  const observedSections = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('main section[id]'));\n  const sectionObserver = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {\n    entries.forEach(function (entry) {\n      if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;\n      navLinks.forEach(function (link) { link.classList.toggle('is-active', link.dataset.section === entry.target.id); });\n    });\n  }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px', threshold: 0 });\n  observedSections.forEach(function (section) { sectionObserver.observe(section); });\n\n  const progress = document.getElementById('scrollProgress');\n  function updateProgress() {\n    const max = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;\n    progress.style.width = (max > 0 ? Math.min(100, (window.scrollY / max) * 100) : 0) + '%';\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('scroll', updateProgress, { passive: true });\n  updateProgress();\n\n  const video = document.getElementById('institutionalVideo');\n  const videoToggle = document.getElementById('videoToggle');\n  if (video && videoToggle) {\n    videoToggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      if (video.paused) { video.play(); videoToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Pausar video'); videoToggle.innerHTML = '<i class=\"bx bx-pause icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>'; }\n      else { video.pause(); videoToggle.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Reproducir video'); videoToggle.innerHTML = '<i class=\"bx bx-play icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>'; }\n    });\n  }\n\n  const serviceRows = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.service-row'));\n  const previewImage = document.getElementById('servicePreviewImage');\n  const previewTag = document.getElementById('servicePreviewTag');\n  const previewTitle = document.getElementById('servicePreviewTitle');\n  const previewDescription = document.getElementById('servicePreviewDescription');\n  const serviceData = {\n    obras: { image: '/api/local/images/static/img/3.jpeg', alt: 'Obra vial en ejecución', tag: 'Construcción / Mantenimiento', title: 'Obras viales', description: 'Diseñamos y ejecutamos intervenciones que ayudan a mantener conectadas a las comunidades de Lara.' },\n    inspecciones: { image: '/api/local/images/static/img/4.jpeg', alt: 'Personal inspeccionando una carretera', tag: 'Supervisión / Seguridad', title: 'Inspecciones técnicas', description: 'Observamos, registramos y acompañamos el cumplimiento técnico y administrativo de los proyectos viales.' },\n    proyectos: { image: '/api/local/images/static/img/5.jpeg', alt: 'Maquinaria para un proyecto vial', tag: 'Planificación / Contratación', title: 'Proyectos y contratos', description: 'Gestionamos proyectos y contrataciones con criterios de transparencia, seguimiento y responsabilidad institucional.' },\n    solicitudes: { image: '/api/local/images/static/img/6.jpeg', alt: 'Equipo atendiendo una solicitud en la vía', tag: 'Comunidad / Atención', title: 'Solicitudes ciudadanas', description: 'La información de la comunidad ayuda a comprender dónde la vialidad necesita atención y seguimiento.' }\n  };\n  function selectService(row, toggleMobile) {\n    const wasActive = row.classList.contains('is-active');\n    if (toggleMobile && wasActive && window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches) {\n      row.classList.remove('is-active'); row.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n      const collapsed = row.querySelector('.service-row-mobile-detail'); if (collapsed) collapsed.hidden = true;\n      return;\n    }\n    const data = serviceData[row.dataset.service];\n    serviceRows.forEach(function (item) {\n      const active = item === row;\n      item.classList.toggle('is-active', active);\n      item.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(active));\n      const detail = item.querySelector('.service-row-mobile-detail');\n      if (detail) detail.hidden = !(active && window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches);\n    });\n    if (!data) return;\n    previewImage.src = data.image; previewImage.alt = data.alt; previewTag.textContent = data.tag; previewTitle.textContent = data.title; previewDescription.textContent = data.description;\n    if (window.gsap) gsap.fromTo(previewImage, { autoAlpha: 0, x: 14 }, { autoAlpha: 1, x: 0, duration: .35, ease: 'power2.out', clearProps: 'transform' });\n  }\n  serviceRows.forEach(function (row) {\n    row.addEventListener('click', function () { selectService(row, true); });\n    row.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { if (!window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches) selectService(row, false); });\n    row.addEventListener('focus', function () { if (!window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)').matches) selectService(row, false); });\n  });\n  if (serviceRows[0]) selectService(serviceRows[0], false);\n\n  if (window.gsap && window.ScrollTrigger) {\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    var reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n    var pageSelector = '#invilara-page';\n    var revealElements = gsap.utils.toArray(pageSelector + ' .js-reveal');\n    var narrativeImages = gsap.utils.toArray(pageSelector + ' .ladder-media img, ' + pageSelector + ' .service-preview-image');\n\n    if (reduceMotion) {\n      gsap.set(revealElements, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, clearProps: 'all' });\n      gsap.set(narrativeImages, { clearProps: 'all' });\n    } else {\n      var heroStory = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } });\n      heroStory\n        .fromTo(pageSelector + ' .hero-grid .js-reveal', { autoAlpha: 0, y: 24 }, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, duration: .62, stagger: .07, clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility' })\n        .fromTo(pageSelector + ' .hero-lead-cell > div', { autoAlpha: 0, y: 18 }, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, duration: .62, clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility' }, .12)\n        .fromTo(pageSelector + ' .hero-signature', { autoAlpha: 0, y: 12 }, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, duration: .48, clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility' }, .48)\n        .fromTo(pageSelector + ' .hero-image-cell img', { scale: 1.06 }, { scale: 1, duration: 1.15, ease: 'power2.out', clearProps: 'transform' }, 0)\n        .fromTo(pageSelector + ' .image-caption', { autoAlpha: 0, y: 12 }, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, duration: .5, clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility' }, .48);\n\n      gsap.utils.toArray(pageSelector + ' .js-reveal').forEach(function (element) {\n        if (element.closest('.hero-grid')) return;\n        gsap.fromTo(element, { autoAlpha: 0, y: 28 }, { autoAlpha: 1, y: 0, duration: .62, ease: 'power2.out', clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility', scrollTrigger: { trigger: element, start: 'top 86%', once: true } });\n      });\n\n      narrativeImages.forEach(function (image) {\n        var frame = image.closest('.ladder-media') || image.closest('.service-preview-image-wrap');\n        if (!frame) return;\n        gsap.to(image, {\n          yPercent: -4,\n          ease: 'none',\n          scrollTrigger: { trigger: frame, start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: .9 }\n        });\n      });\n\n      gsap.to(pageSelector + ' .hero-image-cell img', {\n        yPercent: -3,\n        ease: 'none',\n        scrollTrigger: { trigger: pageSelector + ' .hero-section', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: .8 }\n      });\n      gsap.to(pageSelector + ' .video-cutout', {\n        y: -14,\n        ease: 'none',\n        scrollTrigger: { trigger: pageSelector + ' .video-section', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 }\n      });\n      gsap.to(pageSelector + ' .impact-aside', {\n        y: -10,\n        ease: 'none',\n        scrollTrigger: { trigger: pageSelector + ' .about-section', start: 'top bottom', end: 'bottom top', scrub: 1 }\n      });\n\n      gsap.fromTo(pageSelector + ' .service-row', { autoAlpha: 0, x: -12 }, {\n        autoAlpha: 1,\n        x: 0,\n        duration: .52,\n        ease: 'power2.out',\n        stagger: .08,\n        clearProps: 'transform,opacity,visibility',\n        scrollTrigger: { trigger: pageSelector + ' .service-list', start: 'top 78%', once: true }\n      });\n    }\n\n    window.addEventListener('load', function () { ScrollTrigger.refresh(); }, { once: true });\n  }\n}());\n</script>\n",
